---
layout: base.njk
description: Notes from an iOS engineer on Apple development, the Apple ecosystem and AI.
---
<h1>Notes on my interests</h1>
{% if collections.explainers.length %}
<p class="series-link">Short explainers with diagrams: <a href="/tags/how-it-works/">How it works</a> ({{ collections.explainers.length }})</p>
{% endif %}
{% if collections.essays.length %}
<ul class="post-list">
{%- for post in collections.essays %}
  <li>
    <p class="meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | humanDate }}</time></p>
    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
    <p class="tags">{% for tag in post.data.tags %}<a href="/tags/{{ tag | slugify }}/">#{{ tag }}</a>{% endfor %}</p>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>The first post is coming soon.</p>
{% endif %}
